WEBVTT

00:00:59.716 --> 00:01:02.836
because they think the public
want them to do something else first.

00:01:02.876 --> 00:01:05.716
Brexit, building more houses,

00:01:05.756 --> 00:01:08.716
the economy, Brexit,

00:01:08.756 --> 00:01:10.756
health sector, Brexit.

00:01:10.796 --> 00:01:11.916
(Laughter)

00:01:12.276 --> 00:01:14.836
How do we put the environment
at the top of that list?

00:01:15.156 --> 00:01:17.556
My answer is ... we don’t.

00:01:19.276 --> 00:01:21.516
We look at this the other
way around instead.

00:01:21.556 --> 00:01:24.076
We show how moving to a green economy

00:01:24.116 --> 00:01:27.036
delivers on the things
that people are already worried about.

00:01:27.036 --> 00:01:28.196
It improves their lives,

00:01:28.236 --> 00:01:30.556
whether they care
about the environment or not.